menu "Qymera example application"

config QYMERA_MATTER_ENABLE
    bool "Build the Matter bridge (ESP-Matter SDK required)"
    default n
    help
        Exposes Qymera relays as Matter OnOff endpoints and dimmers as
        LevelControl endpoints. Requires the espressif/esp_matter dependency
        declared in main/idf_component.yml. Keep disabled for a plain Qymera
        build.

endmenu